<title>CANADA: Derlan sells Porcelain Industries unit.</title>
<headline>Derlan sells Porcelain Industries unit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derlan Industries Ltd said on Monday it has completed the sale of its Porcelain Industries Inc subsidiary to PNC Equity Management for proceeds of C$21.5 million.</p>
<p>Derlan said this will result in a gain on sale.</p>
<p>Porcelain is located in Dickson, Tennessee, and coats porcelain enamel on cast iron, steel and other metal products for commercial and industrial markets.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
